10290 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In other words\054 a settlement can only ever burn balanceOf\050holder\051 \055 \137frozenTokens\133holder\135\056 The withdrawal logic\054 however\054 never takes \137frozenTokens into account when it decides how many tokens the settlement will burn\054 nor when it decides how many tokens a holder is allowed to transfer away\056 The two instances below describe how each of those omissions makes a settlement revert with PartialFreezeExceeded\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 10291 0 R
     /Pg 3070 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
