10299 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Since the matured branch passes amount \075\075 balanceOf\050holder\051\054 any nonzero \137frozenTokens\133holder\135 makes \137requireFreeBalance\050\051 fail and the settlement reverts\056\nA partial freeze is meant to immobilise only the frozen portion of a position\054 but here a single frozen base unit makes the holder\047s entire matured position unredeemable\056 The holder has no way out on their own either\072 after maturity normal transfers revert with MaturedTransfersDisabled\054 so the unfrozen part can neither be redeemed nor moved\054 while income accrual has already stopped at maturity\056\nInstance 2\072 a transfer can push the reserved withdrawal into the frozen balance\n\137requestWithdrawal\050\051 deliberately keeps the reserved and the frozen portions of a position disjoint\072)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 10300 0 R
     /Pg 3882 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

