10397 0 obj
  << /ActualText (forcedTransfer can move tokens that are partially frozen\054 but it does not decrease the sender\047s \137frozenTokens counter\056\nAs a result\054 \137frozenTokens\133from\135 can become larger than the wallet\047s actual balance\056 This breaks an accounting invariant used throughout the token and can prevent the wallet from transferring or redeeming its remaining tokens\056\nFor example\072\nA wallet has 1000 tokens\054 all of which are frozen\056\nAn agent calls forcedTransfer\050wallet\054 custodian\054 1000\051\056\nThe wallet now has 0 balance but still has 1000 frozen tokens recorded\056\nThe wallet later receives 500 tokens\056\nAny outbound transfer or settlement reverts with PartialFreezeExceeded\054 because frozenTokens \0501000\051 \076 balance \050500\051\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 10398 0 R
     /Pg 6090 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
