10566 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The SaleFixPrice contract enables users to swap between the sale token and whitelisted stablecoins at a fixed 1\0721 rate via the buyWith\050\051 and sellFor\050\051 functions\056 However\054 the contract lacks administrative controls to pause trading or delist specific stablecoins\056\nIf a supported stablecoin experiences a severe depeg event \050similar to UST\051\054 an attacker can sell the depegged stablecoin to get the contract\047s sale token reserves\056 They can then convert those sale tokens into other assets\054 resulting in significant protocol losses\056 Without a pause or delisting mechanism\054 the protocol has no emergency method to mitigate losses in real time\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 10567 0 R
     /Pg 10026 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

